    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "REA Dooley Group are delighted to introduce this attractive two-bedroom semi-detached property to the market. Presented in very good condition throughout, this bright and cosy home offers well-proportioned accommodation, a welcoming atmosphere and the convenience of town living.\n\nExtending to 67.74 sq. m. (729 sq. ft.), the property is filled with natural light and would make an ideal home for first-time buyers, small families or those looking for a manageable property in a convenient location.\n\nOn entering the property, the entrance hallway features a tiled floor, with stairs leading to the first floor. To the front of the property is the kitchen/dining area, fitted with a shaker-style kitchen, tiled flooring and plumbing for all necessary appliances. A guest WC is conveniently located just off the kitchen and features vinyl flooring.The sitting room is a bright and comfortable space centred around an open fireplace. Newly fitted carpet adds to the cosy feel, while a door provides direct access to the rear garden.\n\nUpstairs, there are two double bedrooms, both featuring timber flooring and skylight openings, providing bright and pleasant bedroom accommodation. The family bathroom is fitted with a white suite, vinyl flooring and an electric shower over the bath, with tiled surround.\n\nExternally, the property is approached via concrete steps, with a concrete driveway providing off-street parking to the front. A side entrance leads through to the enclosed rear garden, which features a lawn area and offers a pleasant outdoor space.\n\nThe property enjoys an excellent location within easy walking distance of local shops, schools and a range of everyday amenities in the market town of Kilfinane. The combination of convenient town living, a strong local community and the surrounding scenic countryside makes this an appealing opportunity for those seeking a comfortable home in a peaceful yet well-connected setting.\n\nViewing is highly recommended to appreciate all that this property has to offer.\n\nFor more information or to arrange a viewing, contact sales agent Derry Walsh 086 2587369/063 30884\n\nEntrance Hall\n1.75m x 1.35m Entrance via front door to hallway, radiator, tiled floor\n\nKitchen/Dining area\n4.18m x 3.00m Tiled floor, built-in units tiled splash back, radiator, power points, blind,\n\nSitting Room\n4.25m x 4.05m Open fireplace, carpet, power points, TV point, radiator, access to rear\n\nGuest WC\n1.80m x 0.90m Vinyl flooring, WC, WHB, tiled splash back\n\nLanding\n1.85m x 1.75m Carpet on stairs and landing, hotpress with immersion\n\nBedroom\n3.32m x 3.00m Timber floor, radiator, power points, Velux\n\nBedroom\n4.03m x 3.05m Timber floor, radiator, power points, Velux\n\nBathroom\n2.05m x 1.75m Vinyl flooring, WC, WHB, bath with shower over, tiled around bath\n\n\nDirections\nV35 VK49\n\nNotice\nPlease note we have not tested any apparatus, fixtures, fittings, or services. Interested parties must undertake their own investigation into the working order of these items. All measurements are approximate and photographs provided for guidance only."
      },
